From cb774ab9044b89d2c7d0f6457fe497e7f95e798e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hans Bihs <hans.bihs@reefconsulting.no>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 09:42:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] SEASTATE: rename REEF3D::Spectral to REEF3D::SEASTATE,
 CodeLite files

- Files spectral_* and fdm_spectral -> seastate_* and fdm_seastate;
  classes, functions and header guards renamed accordingly
  (seastate, seastate_f, seastate_grid, seastate_wavenumber, ...,
  driver::seastate_driver, regression_dump::seastate_*).
- Output: REEF3D_SEASTATE_VTP (REEF3D-SEASTATE-*.vtp/pvtp),
  REEF3D_SEASTATE_Log/REEF3D_SEASTATE_integral.dat, run log solver name
  SEASTATE, screen messages SEASTATE.
- Boundary spectrum file (A 711 2): seastate-boundary.spc.
- CodeLite: all SEASTATE files in Hydrodynamics/SEASTATE (adds the 8
  files that were missing).
No change of the numerics or of the keys (A 10 7, A 700-721).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NGxohKzjNw1NpTUPVB6x5H
